     logo) — the old transparent background let the
     wallpaper show through the launcher mask's corners,
     and the artwork had no safe-zone margin so the mask
     cut the star and the red bar. The foreground artwork
     is now inset to the 66% safe zone, so the mask only
     ever crops navy. -->
